     1140     ) no-error .
     1141   for each thbjattr_thbj-attr :
     1142       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outdate':U  then v-outdate  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1143       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outares':U  then v-outares  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1144       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outnum':U   then v-outnum   =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1145       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outprim':U  then v-outprim  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1146       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outdisc':U  then v-outdisc  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1147       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outsubs':U  then v-outsubs  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1148       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outegrp':U  then v-outegrp  =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
     1149       if thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'outt12':U   then v-outt12   =  thbjattr_thbj-attr.property-value-character .
